["Each trinket slot can swap trinkets by itself (as TrinketMenu's auto queue): put your trinkets in order; when the one you wear goes on cooldown, the first one above the red mark that is ready goes on. A trinket with 30 seconds or less of cooldown counts as ready - putting one on starts a 30 second cooldown anyway. Swaps wait for combat to end. Alt-click a trinket on the trinket bar to switch its slot's queue on or off; a small gear on it shows the queue: gold on, grey holding (Delay), red paused."] = "每个饰品栏位可自动换饰品(类似 TrinketMenu 的自动队列):按顺序排好饰品;当穿戴的饰品进入冷却,红线以上第一个就绪的会换上。冷却 30 秒或更短的饰品视为就绪 - 穿上它反正会开始 30 秒冷却。换装等待战斗结束。在饰品栏上 Alt-点击饰品可开关该栏位的队列;其上的小齿轮显示队列状态:金色 开启,灰色 等待(延迟),红色 暂停。",
