["Tick to show a message. The swatch is its colour. Where it comes from: a screen area, or the nameplate of the other unit. Crit = always shown as a crit. Big = bigger with a flash so it stands out (Crits sets how much). Sound: picking one plays it.\n\nThe sound lists hold the game's alerts, gunshots and explosions, boss kill lines (\"Die, insect!\"), crowd cheers and victory horns, BigWigs' voices and four files of your own."] = "勾选以显示该消息。色块是它的颜色。来源:屏幕区域,或对方单位的姓名板。暴击 = 总以暴击样式显示。放大 = 更大并闪光以突出(幅度在“暴击”中设置)。音效:选择即播放。\n\n音效列表包含游戏的提示音、枪声和爆炸声、首领击杀台词(“Die, insect!”)、人群欢呼和胜利号角、BigWigs 的语音,以及四个你自己的文件。",
["Every kind of plate takes the size of the one you changed last (enemy NPCs if you have not changed one)."] = "每种姓名板都采用你最后修改的那种的大小(未修改过则采用敌方 NPC 的)。",
["Every message type back to how it started (formats too)."] = "所有消息类型恢复初始状态(格式也一样)。",
["Every meter window back to its starting place in the middle of the screen."] = "所有统计窗口回到屏幕中央的初始位置。",
["Every movement explained"] = "每种移动方式的说明",
["Every movement hits can use, plus staying in place. Point at a name in the list to see what it does."] = "命中可用的所有移动方式,外加原地不动。指向列表中的名称可查看其作用。",
["Every nameplate setting - looks, sizes, colours, places, auras, lists - back to how it came (the Plater look). Click twice."] = "所有姓名板设置 - 外观、大小、颜色、位置、光环、列表 - 恢复到初始状态(Plater 外观)。需点击两次。",
["Every other bar that is on gets this bar's button size, spacing and scale, so bars with the same buttons are the same size. Each stays where it is. One bar at a time: Move frames, click a bar, Match size..."] = "其他所有已启用的条采用此条的按钮大小、间距和缩放,使按钮相同的条大小一致。各自位置不变。一次一个条:移动框体,点击条,匹配大小...",
