["Pick a frame with the tabs: its preview shows at the top. Under it, pick what to change: size and bars, text, buffs, icons, look, the raid layout or what all frames share. Click a part of the preview to jump to its card. The cards named \"All frames\" change every frame."] = "用标签选择框体:其预览显示在顶部。其下选择要更改的内容:大小和条、文字、增益、图标、外观、团队布局或所有框体共用的设置。点击预览的某个部分可跳到对应卡片。名为“所有框体”的卡片会改变每个框体。",
["Pick a place below, then how its crits appear and how they move. Point at any name in a list to see what it does."] = "在下方选择一个位置,然后设置其暴击的出现和移动方式。指向列表中的任意名称可查看其作用。",
["Pick a place below, then how its crits appear and how they move. Point at any name in a list to see what it does.\n\nEach place - nameplates and the five scroll areas - has its own crit entrance (how a crit appears: slam in, pop, swell...) and its own crit movement (the same as its hits, staying in place, or any of the movements hits can use), and can give crits their own time on screen, travel and direction. The crit look at the bottom (letters, colour, flash, mark) is for every crit. Crit sounds are on Messages and sounds."] = "在下方选择一个位置,然后设置其暴击的出现和移动方式。指向列表中的任意名称可查看其作用。\n\n每个位置(姓名板和五个滚动区域)都有自己的暴击入场方式(暴击如何出现:砸入、弹出、膨胀...)和自己的暴击移动方式(与命中相同、原地不动,或命中可用的任何移动),并可为暴击设置独立的停留时间、行程和方向。底部的暴击外观(文字、颜色、闪光、标记)适用于所有暴击。暴击音效在“消息和音效”页。",
["Each place - nameplates and the five scroll areas - has its own crit entrance (how a crit appears: slam in, pop, swell...) and its own crit movement (the same as its hits, staying in place, or any of the movements hits can use), and can give crits their own time on screen, travel and direction. The crit look at the bottom (letters, colour, flash, mark) is for every crit. Crit sounds are on Messages and sounds."] = "每个位置(姓名板和五个滚动区域)都有自己的暴击入场方式(暴击如何出现:砸入、弹出、膨胀...)和自己的暴击移动方式(与命中相同、原地不动,或命中可用的任何移动),并可为暴击设置独立的停留时间、行程和方向。底部的暴击外观(文字、颜色、闪光、标记)适用于所有暴击。暴击音效在“消息和音效”页。",
["Pick a window with the tabs above the preview (or make a new one), then change it card by card: each card is one part of the window - the picture on its title says which. Every window has its own settings; the preview shows the one you are editing and every change shows at once. Click a part of the preview to jump to its card. Hover any setting for what it does."] = "用预览上方的标签选择窗口(或新建一个),然后逐张卡片修改:每张卡片是窗口的一个部分 - 标题上的图片说明是哪部分。每个窗口都有自己的设置;预览显示你正在编辑的窗口,所有更改立即可见。点击预览的某个部分可跳到对应卡片。把鼠标移到任意设置上可查看其作用。",
