["Scrolling combat text in five screen areas you place - or rising from nameplates: your damage from the enemy you hit."] = "滚动战斗文字显示在你布置的五个屏幕区域,或从姓名板升起:你的伤害从被你击中的敌人身上升起。",
["Scrolling combat text in five screen areas you place - or rising from nameplates: your damage from the enemy you hit.\n\nEverything SCT and SCT - Damage showed (and Mik's Scrolling Battle Text, NameplateSCT, the game's own options over the years). Test combat text sends sample texts everywhere for a minute; Move frames shows the areas as blue boxes to drag and size.\n\nThe other combat text pages: Scroll areas (where and how text moves), Nameplates (and teammates' damage on them), Crits, Messages and sounds (what shows, its colour, where it comes from), Text and filters, Threat."] = "滚动战斗文字显示在你布置的五个屏幕区域,或从姓名板升起:你的伤害从被你击中的敌人身上升起。\n\nSCT 和 SCT - Damage 显示的一切(以及 Mik's Scrolling Battle Text、NameplateSCT 和游戏历年自带的选项)。测试战斗文字会在各处发送一分钟示例文字;移动框体会把这些区域显示为蓝色方框,可拖动和调整大小。\n\n其他战斗文字页面:滚动区域(文字的位置与移动方式)、姓名板(及其上的队友伤害)、暴击、消息和音效(显示什么、颜色、来源)、文字和过滤、仇恨。",
["Everything SCT and SCT - Damage showed (and Mik's Scrolling Battle Text, NameplateSCT, the game's own options over the years). Test combat text sends sample texts everywhere for a minute; Move frames shows the areas as blue boxes to drag and size.\n\nThe other combat text pages: Scroll areas (where and how text moves), Nameplates (and teammates' damage on them), Crits, Messages and sounds (what shows, its colour, where it comes from), Text and filters, Threat."] = "SCT 和 SCT - Damage 显示的一切(以及 Mik's Scrolling Battle Text、NameplateSCT 和游戏历年自带的选项)。测试战斗文字会在各处发送一分钟示例文字;移动框体会把这些区域显示为蓝色方框,可拖动和调整大小。\n\n其他战斗文字页面:滚动区域(文字的位置与移动方式)、姓名板(及其上的队友伤害)、暴击、消息和音效(显示什么、颜色、来源)、文字和过滤、仇恨。",
