["Talents changed some other way (the device's own menu, another addon): when they match one of your specs, this window marks it as on. Gear and spells are left alone."] = "天赋以其他方式改变(装置自身菜单、其他插件):与你的某个方案匹配时,此窗口会将其标为启用。装备和法术不受影响。",
["Talk to a Goblin Brainwashing Device and this window takes the place of its menu: each talent slot with its name, picture and talents. Pick a gear set and a UI layout for each; when you switch, the set goes on (armour after combat), the layout changes and the spec's own spells go back on your bars. /gear specs or /specs opens it anywhere to change what goes with each spec."] = "与地精洗脑装置对话时,此窗口会取代它的菜单:每个天赋栏位带有名称、图片和天赋。为每个栏位选择一个装备套装和一个界面布局;切换时,套装穿上(护甲在战斗后)、布局切换,该方案自己的法术回到你的动作条。/gear specs 或 /specs 可在任何地方打开,以更改每个方案的搭配。",
