["Text set to \"Nameplate\" rises from the other unit's plate and follows it - and your team's damage can too."] = "设为“姓名板”的文字从对方单位的姓名板升起并跟随它 - 队友的伤害也可以。",
["Text set to \"Nameplate\" rises from the other unit's plate and follows it - and your team's damage can too.\n\nThe damage you deal rises from the enemy you hit (every enemy, not just your target), the damage you take from whoever hit you. Your damage starts that way; any message can (Messages page).\n\nA plate has to be on screen: enemy nameplates on (V), within nameplate range. With no plate the text goes to the fallback area. Works with pfUI's nameplates.\n\nTeammates: the damage your party deals rises from the plate of whoever they hit - smaller, in their class colour, in a column beside your own numbers. Your own damage is never shown twice, and teammates' text never goes to the screen areas."] = "设为“姓名板”的文字从对方单位的姓名板升起并跟随它 - 队友的伤害也可以。\n\n你造成的伤害从被你击中的敌人身上升起(每个敌人,不只是目标),你受到的伤害从击中你的人身上升起。你的伤害默认如此;任何消息都可以(消息页)。\n\n姓名板必须在屏幕上:开启敌方姓名板(V),且在姓名板范围内。没有姓名板时文字会进入备用区域。适用于 pfUI 的姓名板。\n\n队友:你的队伍造成的伤害从被击中者的姓名板升起 - 较小、使用其职业颜色,在你自己数字旁的一列。你自己的伤害不会重复显示,队友的文字也不会进入屏幕区域。",
["The damage you deal rises from the enemy you hit (every enemy, not just your target), the damage you take from whoever hit you. Your damage starts that way; any message can (Messages page).\n\nA plate has to be on screen: enemy nameplates on (V), within nameplate range. With no plate the text goes to the fallback area. Works with pfUI's nameplates.\n\nTeammates: the damage your party deals rises from the plate of whoever they hit - smaller, in their class colour, in a column beside your own numbers. Your own damage is never shown twice, and teammates' text never goes to the screen areas."] = "你造成的伤害从被你击中的敌人身上升起(每个敌人,不只是目标),你受到的伤害从击中你的人身上升起。你的伤害默认如此;任何消息都可以(消息页)。\n\n姓名板必须在屏幕上:开启敌方姓名板(V),且在姓名板范围内。没有姓名板时文字会进入备用区域。适用于 pfUI 的姓名板。\n\n队友:你的队伍造成的伤害从被击中者的姓名板升起 - 较小、使用其职业颜色,在你自己数字旁的一列。你自己的伤害不会重复显示,队友的文字也不会进入屏幕区域。",
