["The arrow moves to that edge unless you dragged it."] = "箭头会移到该边缘,除非你拖动过它。",
["The arrow on or off (Chat > Panel arrow)."] = "开关箭头(聊天 > 面板箭头)。",
["The art at the ends of the main bar: the game's gryphon, lion and dragons."] = "主动作条两端的图案:游戏中的狮鹫、狮子和龙。",
["The art of this mark; None = no mark."] = "此标记的图案;无 = 无标记。",
["The bar colour for this name. No colour = only the new name."] = "此名称的条颜色。无颜色 = 只改新名字。",
["The bar in my colour"] = "条使用我的颜色",
["The bar lights up under the mouse."] = "鼠标指向时条会亮起。",
["The bar shows health missing."] = "条显示缺失的生命。",
["The bar's colour once the mob is in execute range."] = "怪物进入斩杀范围后条的颜色。",
["The border or bar colour used by \"Mark my own bar\"."] = "“标记我自己的条”所用的边框或条颜色。",
["The box you type in, speech bubbles, invites, scrolling, searching and commands."] = "输入框、对话气泡、邀请、滚动、搜索和命令。",
["The buff bars are made when you log in: switching one on or off shows after a reload."] = "增益条在登录时创建:开关某条在重载后生效。",
