["The button that sends the window to chat."] = "将窗口内容发送到聊天的按钮。",
["The cast bars under the player, target and focus frames. Pick one with the tabs; the colours and texture at the bottom are for all of them."] = "玩家、目标和焦点框体下方的施法条。用标签选择一个;底部的颜色和材质适用于全部。",
["The cast bars use the unit frames' font (after a reload)."] = "施法条使用单位框体的字体(重载后)。",
["The character and inspect windows' look: a dark title shade with a thin line, your race's scenery behind the model and a square Enchants button. Off: pfUI's plain look. Takes a reload."] = "角色和观察窗口的外观:带细线的深色标题底纹、模型后方你种族的场景图,以及方形的附魔按钮。关闭:pfUI 的朴素外观。需要重载。",
["The choices under a movement: which of them show depends on the movement picked."] = "移动方式下方的选项:显示哪些取决于所选的移动方式。",
["The class picture on each bar."] = "每个条上的职业图片。",
["The client's floating damage over targets (CombatDamage)."] = "客户端在目标头顶飘出的伤害(CombatDamage)。",
["The colour a bar lights up in when you point at it (click it for its breakdown)."] = "指向条时它亮起的颜色(点击查看明细)。",
["The colour and see-through of the window behind the bars."] = "条后方窗口的颜色和透明度。",
["The colour behind the title."] = "标题后方的颜色。",
["The colour crits use when 'Crits in their own colour' is ticked."] = "勾选“暴击使用专属颜色”时暴击所用的颜色。",
["The colour of that line."] = "该行的颜色。",
["The colour used when Colour is \"One colour\"."] = "颜色为“单一颜色”时使用的颜色。",
["The colour used when class colours are off."] = "关闭职业颜色时使用的颜色。",
["The coloured bars, one per player or row."] = "彩色条,每名玩家或每行一条。",
["The corner they start from; drag them in the preview to move them from there."] = "它们起始的角落;在预览中拖动可从那里移动。",
