["The damage you deal - from the enemy's nameplate or on screen."] = "你造成的伤害 - 来自敌人姓名板或屏幕上。",
["The dark part grows as the time runs out (with ClassicAPI)."] = "时间减少时深色部分增大(需要 ClassicAPI)。",
["The dark part over a button cooling down."] = "冷却中按钮上的深色部分。",
["The defaults suit most people."] = "默认设置适合大多数人。",
["The display this window opens with and the fight it follows (its title bar changes both while you play)."] = "此窗口打开时的显示内容及其跟随的战斗(游戏中可通过标题栏更改两者)。",
["The edge around the health and cast bars."] = "生命条和施法条周围的边缘。",
["The edge round the window. Soft glow and Accent follow your accent colour."] = "窗口周围的边缘。柔和光效和强调色跟随你的强调色。",
