["The empty part of the bar."] = "条的空白部分。",
["The empty part of the cast bar (lighter than the health bar's, so a new cast shows)."] = "施法条的空白部分(比生命条的更亮,以便新施法可见)。",
["The fill of the health and cast bars. The Octo ones are pfUI Octo's own art."] = "生命条和施法条的填充。Octo 系列为 pfUI Octo 自有图案。",
["The font and outline of every text on plates."] = "姓名板上所有文字的字体和描边。",
["The font of every unit frame; try it on the preview above. A frame can use its own on Text colours and font."] = "所有单位框体的字体;可在上方预览中试用。框体可在“文字颜色和字体”中使用自己的字体。",
["The frame in the colour of its debuff (magic blue, curse purple, poison green, disease brown)."] = "框体使用其减益的颜色(魔法蓝、诅咒紫、中毒绿、疾病棕)。",
["The game's crit: the number pops and moves on."] = "游戏自带的暴击:数字弹出后继续移动。",
["The game's empty slot"] = "游戏的空格子",
["The game's own frames - player and target, action bars, minimap, buffs, chat and the rest - instead of pfUI Octo's, with everything pfUI Octo adds (meters, combat text, gear sets, specs, nameplate extras...) still on. Blizzard's frames move in Move frames like pfUI's, and each UI layout keeps its own places. Changes at once, no reload; Esc menu > \"pfUI Octo: undo Blizzard\" always goes back."] = "使用游戏自带的框体 - 玩家和目标、动作条、小地图、增益、聊天等 - 代替 pfUI Octo 的,同时 pfUI Octo 添加的一切(统计、战斗文字、装备套装、天赋方案、姓名板附加项...)仍然保留。暴雪的框体可像 pfUI 的一样在移动框体中移动,每个界面布局保留自己的位置。立即生效,无需重载;Esc 菜单 > “pfUI Octo: undo Blizzard” 可随时切回。",
["The game's own loot window flashes up for each corpse; this closes it. Off: a window that opens is left for you."] = "游戏自带的拾取窗口会为每具尸体弹出,此项会将其关闭。关闭:打开的窗口留给你自己处理。",
["The game's own numbers"] = "游戏自带数字",
["The gap between bars."] = "条之间的间距。",
["The guild under a player's name."] = "玩家名字下方的公会。",
["The health bar fills from the bottom up."] = "生命条从下往上填充。",
["The health just lost stays a moment and fades away."] = "刚失去的生命会停留片刻后淡去。",
["The icon changes colour when the action cannot be used right now."] = "动作当前无法使用时图标变色。",
["The icons next to the minimap."] = "小地图旁的图标。",
["The item's tooltip on the gear buttons, trinket bar and item menus. They never cover an item menu."] = "装备按钮、饰品栏和物品菜单上的物品提示。它们绝不会遮住物品菜单。",
["The key, macro name and count on each button. The cooldown number is under Cooldowns."] = "每个按钮上的按键、宏名称和计数。冷却数字在“冷却”下。",
["The label by your target's nameplate (or in a box you place)."] = "你目标姓名板旁的标签(或你放置的框内)。",
["The label turns yellow at this share of your cap."] = "达到你上限的这个比例时标签变黄。",
["The last part of a text's time it fades away in."] = "文字时间的最后一段,用于淡出。",
["The layout that goes on here."] = "在此启用的布局。",
["The letters of names and numbers on plates."] = "姓名板上名字和数字的字体。",
["The letters, size, outline and speed of every combat text. Areas can pick their own on Scroll areas."] = "所有战斗文字的字体、大小、描边和速度。各区域可在滚动区域中自行选择。",
["The line in big letters at the top of the screen for a few seconds."] = "在屏幕顶部以大字显示几秒钟的一行。",
["The look round every button, the icon, and what fills an empty slot. Ready-made looks: General."] = "每个按钮周围的外观、图标,以及空格子的填充。现成外观:常规。",
["The main chat panel. Move it with Move frames."] = "主聊天面板。用移动框体移动它。",
["The main hand bar changes colour while an attack waits on your next swing."] = "有攻击在等待下次挥击时,主手条会变色。",
["The main number on the right."] = "右侧的主要数字。",
["The map zooms all the way out after this long (0 = never)."] = "过了这么久后地图会完全缩小(0 = 从不)。",
["The map's look: a ready-made style, its shape, border, the spell art around it, size and opacity. Buttons and texts around it are on \"Buttons and text\"."] = "地图的外观:现成样式、形状、边框、周围的法术图案、大小和不透明度。周围的按钮和文字在“按钮和文字”页。",
["The marker in pfUI Octo's accent colour."] = "标记使用 pfUI Octo 的强调色。",
["The minimap and everything on it (zone name, clock, buttons, the bar under it) hide while you are in these places, and come back when you leave."] = "你在这些地点时,小地图及其上的一切(区域名、时钟、按钮、下方的条)会隐藏,离开后恢复。",
["The name on the left and the numbers on the right."] = "名字在左,数字在右。",
["The name turns orange while the unit fights."] = "单位战斗时名字变橙色。",
["The off hand as a thin bar inside the main hand's."] = "副手以细条显示在主手条内。",
["The order of total, per second and percent on the right."] = "右侧总计、每秒和百分比的顺序。",
["The outline takes pfUI Octo's accent colour."] = "描边使用 pfUI Octo 的强调色。",
["The part you picked. Click a part in the preview to pick it there."] = "你选择的部分。在预览中点击某部分即可选中。",
["The pattern of the bar's fill."] = "条填充的图案。",
["The per-second and percent figures and their brackets."] = "每秒和百分比数值及其括号。",
["The points pulse when you have all five."] = "集齐五点时连击点会脉动。",
["The pull point: where the mob turns to you (110% of the tank's threat in melee, 130% at range). The top player: stay behind the tank; the top two or three: behind the off-tank or a big hitter too."] = "拉仇恨点:怪物转向你的位置(近战为坦克仇恨的 110%,远程为 130%)。最高玩家:留在坦克之后;前两三名:也要在副坦克或高输出者之后。",
["The same as clicking the meters button on your screen."] = "与点击屏幕上的统计按钮相同。",
["The same as the arrow at the right end of the bottom-right bar."] = "与右下条右端的箭头相同。",
["The same attack on the same enemy within the merge window (Text and filters) adds to the number already there: \"1840 x3\" instead of three lines."] = "合并时间窗口内(文字和过滤)对同一敌人的相同攻击会累加到已有数字上:“1840 x3”而不是三行。",
