["The seconds counting down on every cooldown."] = "每个冷却上倒数的秒数。",
["The set button (click: your sets) and the minimap button."] = "套装按钮(点击:你的套装)和小地图按钮。",
["The set picked on the left."] = "左侧选中的套装。",
["The set worn while this lasts."] = "此期间穿着的套装。",
["The shot's name and the time left."] = "射击的名称和剩余时间。",
["The size of your own arrow on the map."] = "地图上你自己箭头的大小。",
["The small arrow at the right end of the bottom-right bar (time and fps), as pfUI always had it: a click opens or shuts the window above it. Loot & Spam: the window opens with Loot & Spam in it, and on shutting Loot & Spam goes back to a tab in the left chat. Meters: the window opens with your meter windows docked in it, side by side. In Move frames, right-click that bar to come here."] = "右下条右端的小箭头(时间和 fps),同 pfUI 一贯的样子:点击打开或关闭其上方的窗口。拾取和刷屏:窗口打开时显示拾取和刷屏,关闭后拾取和刷屏回到左侧聊天的一个标签。统计:窗口打开时并排停靠你的统计窗口。在移动框体中,右键点击该条即可来到这里。",
["The space between buttons on all bars (one bar: Bars page)."] = "所有条上按钮之间的间距(单个条:条页面)。",
["The spell name and time."] = "法术名称和时间。",
["The spell's icon next to its number."] = "数字旁的法术图标。",
["The spell's name (and rank) on the left, the timer on the right."] = "法术名称(和等级)在左,计时在右。",
["The stack count on the icon."] = "图标上的层数。",
["The strip at the top: the display's name, the fight, and the buttons."] = "顶部一栏:显示名称、战斗和按钮。",
["The strip under the bars."] = "条下方的一栏。",
["The tabs over each chat panel."] = "每个聊天面板上方的标签。",
