["The thin border round the health and cast bars."] = "生命条和施法条周围的细边框。",
["The time and name of the fight beside the title."] = "标题旁战斗的时间和名称。",
["The title's colour when it is not in the accent colour."] = "标题不使用强调色时的颜色。",
["The way the text travels: straight up, in an arc, sideways, bouncing... Point at a name in the list to see what it does. The choices under it change to the ways that movement can go."] = "文字的移动方式:笔直向上、弧线、横向、弹跳...指向列表中的名称可查看其作用。其下的选项会随该移动方式可用的变化而变化。",
["The whole UI"] = "整个界面",
