["Wear a set while something is happening - riding, swimming, in a stance or form, in a city, a battleground or a raid - and put back what you wore when it ends. The first one in the list that is happening wins. Armour waits for combat to end (weapons swap at once); everything waits while you are dead or casting."] = "在发生某事时穿上某套装 - 骑乘、游泳、处于某姿态或形态、在城市、战场或团队中 - 结束时换回原来的装备。列表中第一个正在发生的事件优先。护甲等待战斗结束(武器立即更换);死亡或施法时一切都要等待。",
["Web links"] = "网页链接",
