["What every text says, what is left out, which buffs are procs, and each message's wording."] = "每个文字显示什么、省略什么、哪些增益算触发,以及每条消息的措辞。",
["What every text says, what is left out, which buffs are procs, and each message's wording.\n\nFormats: %a amount, %s spell, buff, item or other thing, %n the other unit's name, %t the kind (Dodge, Fire, Rage, Falling...). Spell names and names are added by themselves when the format leaves them out and their boxes under What the texts say are ticked. Press Enter to save; empty = the original.\n\nLists: names separated by commas, as the game spells them. Press Enter to save."] = "每个文字显示什么、省略什么、哪些增益算触发,以及每条消息的措辞。\n\n格式:%a 数值,%s 法术、增益、物品或其他事物,%n 对方单位的名字,%t 种类(躲闪、火焰、怒气、坠落...)。当格式省略法术名和名字、且“文字显示什么”下相应的框已勾选时,它们会自动补上。按回车保存;留空 = 原样。\n\n列表:名字用逗号分隔,写法同游戏中。按回车保存。",
["Formats: %a amount, %s spell, buff, item or other thing, %n the other unit's name, %t the kind (Dodge, Fire, Rage, Falling...). Spell names and names are added by themselves when the format leaves them out and their boxes under What the texts say are ticked. Press Enter to save; empty = the original.\n\nLists: names separated by commas, as the game spells them. Press Enter to save."] = "格式:%a 数值,%s 法术、增益、物品或其他事物,%n 对方单位的名字,%t 种类(躲闪、火焰、怒气、坠落...)。当格式省略法术名和名字、且“文字显示什么”下相应的框已勾选时,它们会自动补上。按回车保存;留空 = 原样。\n\n列表:名字用逗号分隔,写法同游戏中。按回车保存。",
